# Dev Notes 43 — Runtime Model Bundle Registry v1

**Date:** 2026-06-17  
**Branch:** `runtime-model-bundle-registry-v1`  
**Status:** Final candidate package prepared for the declared contract-only scope; assistant sandbox syntax checks, targeted model-bundle contract smoke, existing contract-chain smokes, fixture helper checks, worker import-cycle check, public-entrypoint guard, artifact guard, package extraction, package recheck, and Michael-run local Windows/MINGW64 checks passed. Not repo-verified after upload, not merged, and not main-verified.

---

## 1. Purpose

This branch adds the first contract-only model bundle registry namespace under:

```text
runtime/models/
```

The namespace validates static model bundle metadata for future routing/backend execution work. It makes the model-bundle boundary explicit:

```text
requests and plans select configured model bundles by modelBundleId
registry/config-like metadata owns model artifact layout details
runtime/model/worker code does not accept request-time raw model paths
```

This is not model execution. It does not load models, check filesystem paths, call backends, call services, enqueue runtime requests, stream tokens, route `prompt()` through the Capability Bus, or expose a public `executeAction()` API.

